<title>USA: EG&amp;G names CEO Kucharski as president.</title>
<headline>EG&amp;G names CEO Kucharski as president.</headline>
<dateline>WELLESLEY, Mass 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>EG&amp;G Inc said Wednesday it elected its chairman and chief executive officer, John Kucharski, to the additional post of president.</p>
<p>Kucharski replaces Fred Parks as president, the company said. Parks resigned on January 10.</p>
<p>EG&amp;G is a global technology company that also provides systems and components to the automotive, medical, aerospace, photography and other industries. It has annual sales of more than $1.4 billion.</p>
